  "set": "kernel/public/v1/book-draw",
  "kernelVersion": 1,
  "spec": "SuperEngine fairness kernel, kernelVersion 1: book Draw and Payout, drawAlgorithmVersion 1",
  "description": "Draw(seed, table) then Payout(bet, multiplierMilli): the outcome of a book round. A table is drawAlgorithmVersion and rows of (weight, multiplierMilli), with 1000 milli = 1x. Checks, in order: drawAlgorithmVersion is 1 (else draw-algorithm-version); then WeightedDraw's checks over the rows' weights in row order (see the weighted-draw set); then 1 <= bet <= 2^128 - 1 (else bet-out-of-range). index, r and acceptedAtCtr are WeightedDraw(seed, weights) unchanged, the multipliers are not an input to the draw, multiplierMilli is the drawn row's, and payout = floor(bet * multiplierMilli / 1000), at most 2^128 - 1 (else payout-too-large)",
